00:39:51,912 --> 00:39:55,014
[SPEAKER_00]: She said, oh, that's the scouting material.

581
00:39:55,134 --> 00:39:57,235
[SPEAKER_00]: He didn't see me as a scout.

582
00:39:57,275 --> 00:39:59,817
[SPEAKER_02]: Still is, huh?

583
00:39:59,837 --> 00:40:01,718
[SPEAKER_02]: That's what she said.

584
00:40:01,798 --> 00:40:05,221
[SPEAKER_02]: I didn't get into that at all.

585
00:40:05,261 --> 00:40:06,241
[SPEAKER_02]: 52 years of marriage.

586
00:40:07,242 --> 00:40:09,123
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah, they've been married 52 years.

587
00:40:10,204 --> 00:40:11,685
[SPEAKER_02]: Is that all you got to say about that point?

