00:40:37,093 --> 00:40:38,694
[SPEAKER_00]: And I said, you know... M. What is it?

598
00:40:38,774 --> 00:40:39,294
[SPEAKER_00]: Cuccinelli.

599
00:40:41,023 --> 00:40:42,384
[SPEAKER_00]: He lives on that street.

600
00:40:42,564 --> 00:40:43,784
[SPEAKER_00]: Oh, his name's Tony.

601
00:40:44,505 --> 00:40:46,626
[SPEAKER_00]: I said, you know, he's great friends with Lopez.

