00:40:51,608 --> 00:40:52,068
[SPEAKER_00]: I know.

606
00:40:52,729 --> 00:40:55,090
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, that's why you asked me about the stories of Tony.

607
00:40:55,110 --> 00:40:56,010
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, that's on our couchinello list.

