00:41:04,214 --> 00:41:05,054
[SPEAKER_02]: Tony Lopez.

611
00:41:07,856 --> 00:41:10,437
[SPEAKER_02]: Got here about 10 children, her family.

612
00:41:10,898 --> 00:41:11,719
[SPEAKER_02]: I told you that.

