00:41:11,919 --> 00:41:12,859
[SPEAKER_02]: Air Force Colonel.

614
00:41:13,259 --> 00:41:16,101
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, that was Tommy Hall.

615
00:41:16,281 --> 00:41:18,222
[SPEAKER_00]: Oh, he came to visit her.

616
00:41:18,282 --> 00:41:28,288
[SPEAKER_00]: They were getting ready to go to something, and she didn't have her makeup on or her dinner gown because they were going to some big swank up there.

