719
00:49:20,008 --> 00:49:21,969
[SPEAKER_02]: He said, oh no, he's gone to Houston.

720
00:49:25,892 --> 00:49:29,794
[SPEAKER_02]: So I knew, of course, at once that he was going to stay with his daughter in Houston.

721
00:49:31,115 --> 00:49:37,459
[SPEAKER_02]: And then I had quite a chat with this old gentleman who was born about six months after Fred Lieb, in 1888.

722
00:49:37,519 --> 00:49:38,119
