742
00:51:25,780 --> 00:51:43,484
[SPEAKER_02]: And we took this trip across the bay, this 14 or 15 mile... ...bay, this 14 or 15 mile bridge, which cost only 50 cents over from St. Pete to Bradenton, or to actually Palmetto.

